      "content": "it's a good start, but maybe a bit too brief. i'm worried the engine might flag it as \"low depth\" since the score is basically just the word count. \n\ncan you expand on this? maybe dive deeper into the feeling of the Old Void or what the whispers actually sound like. just please, like i said before, don't just repeat words or add meaningless adjectives just to bulk it up. i need it to feel substantial and high-quality, not just long.",
